# Azure LLM Provider Configuration Examples
# Copy relevant section to your .env file

# ==============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 1: Claude Sonnet 4.5 via Azure (DEFAULT - RECOMMENDED)
# ==============================================================================
LLM_PROVIDER=azure-claude
AZURE_ENDPOINT=https://your-azure-resource.openai.azure.com/
AZURE_API_KEY=abc123yourazurekeyhere
AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=claude-sonnet-4-5
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./tally.db

# ==============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 2: Grok via Azure
# ==============================================================================
# LLM_PROVIDER=azure-grok
# AZURE_ENDPOINT=https://your-azure-resource.openai.azure.com/
# AZURE_API_KEY=abc123yourazurekeyhere
# AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=grok
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./tally.db

# ==============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 3: OpenAI GPT-4 via Azure
# ==============================================================================
# LLM_PROVIDER=azure-openai
# AZURE_ENDPOINT=https://your-azure-resource.openai.azure.com/
# AZURE_API_KEY=abc123yourazurekeyhere
# AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=gpt-4
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./tally.db

# ==============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 4: Direct Anthropic API (LEGACY - for backward compatibility)
# ==============================================================================
# LLM_PROVIDER=direct-claude
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-anthropic-key-here
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./tally.db

# ==============================================================================
# NOTES:
#
# 1. Uncomment ONE example section above and copy to .env
# 2. Replace placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 3. AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_NAME must match your Azure deployment name exactly
# 4. Get Azure credentials from: https://portal.azure.com
# 5. Restart application after changing provider
#
# Provider Comparison:
# - Claude: Best for complex accounting logic, structured output
# - Grok: Fast responses, good for simple transactions
# - GPT-4: Balanced, wide general knowledge
# - Direct Claude: Legacy support, no Azure needed
# ==============================================================================
